  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Established in 1998, MIFTAH (Palestinian Initiative for the Promotion of Global Dialogue and Democracy), is a Ramallah based NGO. It is active on democracy and good governance issues, and has a number of reputable programmes which seek to enhance the role of women in public life. The focus is on five priority areas: freedom of movement, absence of rule of law, rights or prisoners and detainees, women&apos;s rights and democratic development. A significant part of MIFTAH&apos;s Action plan includes focus o civic engagament, youth and women&apos;s political participation.</narrative>
  </description>
